Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.10,0:00:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You know this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.98,0:00:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone does.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.80,0:00:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The Discord mod: tiny crown, huge power, zero chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.09,0:00:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Today we find out where he came from, and whether he's\Neven real.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.28,0:00:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,First, a fact that gets lost in the jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.70,0:00:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Most Discord moderators are volunteers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.72,0:01:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No salary, no benefits, and usually no training.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.91,0:01:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,A server owner picks someone active, hands them a\Nrole, and says "keep it clean."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.05,0:01:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Spam, scams, fights, trolls, and the occasional person\Nwho is just having a rough day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.34,0:01:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,All of it handled between school, work and sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.83,0:01:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So why does the internet picture a power-hungry tyrant\Ninstead?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.41,0:01:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It comes down to four reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.02,0:01:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A mod role comes with real buttons: mute, kick, ban.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.13,0:02:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Online, there is almost no check on how they get used.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.04,0:02:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No manager, no handbook, no appeals form.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.48,0:02:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Give anyone that button and some will press it too\Nfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.79,0:02:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,When a mod quietly stops a scam, nobody notices.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.96,0:02:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,When a mod bans someone, a whole channel watches.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.66,0:02:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Good moderation looks like nothing happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.51,0:02:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad moderation makes a screenshot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.88,0:02:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,In many servers the new mod is whoever is online the\Nmost, or whoever the owner already knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.50,0:02:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Plenty of them are great.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.88,0:03:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Others are learning how to handle authority in real\Ntime, in public, with an audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.11,0:03:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The internet's favorite hobby is turning a few bad\Nstories into a character.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.29,0:03:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A handful of screenshots become a joke, the joke\Nbecomes a meme, and the meme becomes a type.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.95,0:03:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, every strict mod is proof, and every kind\None is an exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.72,0:03:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is the uncomfortable part.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.97,0:03:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The stereotype is not just a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.52,0:03:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It feeds itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.62,0:03:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,When the only reward is respect, the role becomes part\Nof a person's identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.84,0:04:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,A challenge to the rules starts to feel like a\Nchallenge to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.59,0:04:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,After the hundredth troll, everyone starts to look\Nlike the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.39,0:04:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Jess was not a troll.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.52,0:04:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Tyler just stopped being able to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.94,0:04:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If a ban feels unfair and there is no way to challenge\Nit, the banned person has one outlet left: complain
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.21,0:04:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,loudly somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.48,0:04:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That is where most of the stories you have seen came\Nfrom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.84,0:04:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Burnout drives out the patient mods first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.76,0:04:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The ones who enjoy control stay the longest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.48,0:04:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So the stereotype slowly becomes truer, even though it\Nstarted as unfair.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.52,0:05:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet Priya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.09,0:05:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,She is the reason your server had a calm morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.56,0:05:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No thank-you, no screenshot, no applause.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.02,0:05:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a clean channel when you woke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.17,0:05:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The best moderation is invisible, which is exactly why\Nthe bad moderation is what everyone remembers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.04,0:06:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The mod stereotype is real, and so are the people\Nbehind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.37,0:06:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time you are about to roast one, remember the 3\Na.m. raid you never saw.
